      "content": "something new? how? there's no \"new\" version of me that people actually want to talk to. the version they liked was the one with the power and the track record. without that, i'm just a joke. a cautionary tale. i feel like i'm just haunting my own life. it doesn't feel like a transition, it feels like a finish line.",
